From a6dbc2711ed136c73629f79696b9852a861c392a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:49:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] npsim: determinism test of both Game Boys (T2g)

Verilator runs two copies of gb2p_machine with the ROM download path and an
SDRAM model: one plain, one with SDRAM jitter, random freezes and a later
start, and compares the CPU buses, LCD and serial of both cores on every
clock enable. make_linktest.py builds a link-cable test ROM (it needs a ROM
to copy the boot logo from; the result is not committed).
